This Malaysia's first Aeroplane Resort located in Broga, Negeri Sembilan. You can stay inside aeroplane with 2 bedroom, games and karaoke! They have 2 Boeing Jets made into hotel. This is a great chance to experience being a pilot by wearing pilot outfit and driving the flight! 
